in an Oil Palm Plantation Soil
Wan Noni Afida Ab Manan,1* Fazrul Razman Sulaiman,1 Rubaiyah Alias1
and Rusdin Laiman2
Faculty of Applied Sciences, Universiti Teknologi MARA Pahang,
Bandar Tun Abdul Razak, Jengka, 26400, Pahang, Malaysia
