+
+| Market | Cd (ppm) | Cr (ppm) | Pb (ppm) | tAs (ppm) | Cu (ppm) | Fe (ppm) |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
+| Ankpa | 0.010 | <0.001 | <0.001 | 0.040 | <0.001 | 1.880 |
+| Anyigba | 0.001 | <0.001 | <0.001 | 0.290 | 0.006 | 4.660 |
